body:
The British Film Institute (BFI) is looking for a supplier to provide a Hybrid Security Operations Centre (SOC) on a 1+1+1 year basis.
It will consist a 24/7 for 365 days SOC with a Hybrid SOC Service Design for a new Hybrid SOC Operating Model by end of BFI’s financial year end Q4-2027, 31 March 2027.
At the end of the first contracted year, the Supplier shall have established a demonstrable operational capability that enables BFI to:
- Continuously monitor agreed critical systems;
- Detect priority cyber threats;
- Investigate security events;
- Respond to P1/P2 incidents;
- Undertake proactive threat hunting;
- Maintain protected security logs;
- Demonstrate appropriate incident escalation;
- Provide management-level security reporting; and
- Identify and remediate material monitoring gaps.
To take part in this tender, please visit our website, at https://in-tendhost.co.uk/bfi/aspx/Tenders/Current , where you will need to register, if you haven’t already, and express an interest in this opportunity to access the relevant documents. Please note expressions of interest will only be accepted via the portal.
